 double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"518\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011학년도 1학기&nbsp; 타대학 수학안내 </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><strong>1. 지원자격</strong> : 아래의 각 호에 해당하는 자 (아래 가,나,다 모두 충족하여야 함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">본교 재학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">으로서 2개학기 이상을 이수한 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 나. 이수성적 평점평균이 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3.0 이상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">인 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 수학기간 : 1개학기단위 수학 ( 졸업까지 타대학에서 2개 학기(1년) 이내로 수학 가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 등 록 금 : 금오공과대학교 등록금 납부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 신청서 제출장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">각 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">&nbsp;(※ 테크노관 학사행정실 478-7359 /디지털관 학사행정실 478-7751 /글로벌관 학사행정실 478-7598 )</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">5. 제출서류 : 타대학수학신청원 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6. 신청학점 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">18학점 이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 타대학 수학 신청시 유의사항</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 1. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">선수과목 이수여부를 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">한 후 신청 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 2.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\"> \"</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">8학기차졸업예정자\" 및 2011학년도 2학기 타대학 편입학 예정자는 신청 불가</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 이미 이수한 교과목과 동일한 교과목의 학점은 인정하지 않음(재수강 불가)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 기타 자세한 내용은 각 대학별 타교생 수학안내문을 참조하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"401\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"32\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;2011학년도 1학기 타대학별 수학신청안내</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"102\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"36\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">대학명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4